meta {
  name: List DNS zones
  type: http
  seq: 16
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/dns-zones
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Your DNS zones, paginated with `page` and `per_page` (up to 200), each with its provider, record count, tags and delegation state. Filter with `search`, `credential`, `tag` or `status` (`active`, `stale`, `drift` for zones whose live DNS disagrees with InfraNest — their nameservers or records —, `outside` for zones with edits made directly at the DNS provider that nobody has kept or undone yet, or `security`) and sort with `sort` (`zone`, `provider`, `records`, `synced`) and `dir`; `meta.counts` holds the totals. Each zone’s `outside_changes` counts its undecided edits made at the provider.

  Scope: `dns.read`
}
